OL,3,GNEWSATurkish yard hands over second
OL,4,ACalMac ferry after delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second of four new CalMac ferries
OL,7,Fbeing built by a Turkish shipyard has
OL,8,Fbeen formally handed over after a
OL,9,Fseries of delays.
OL,11,FMV Loch Indaal was originally due to be
OL,12,Fhanded over in February 2025 and then
OL,13,Fagain at the end of last month, with a
OL,14,Fglobal shortage in shipyard workers
OL,15,Fgiven as a reason for the delays.
OL,17,FThe vessel can carry 450 passengers and
OL,18,F100 cars or 14 HGVs, and it should take
OL,19,Fabout two weeks to reach Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
